{"crc":"cd637757","kind":"Candidate","payload":{"response":"The issue is that `check_filterable` in `django/db/models/sql/query.py` is checking if the model instance has a `filterable` attribute, which conflicts with the field named `filterable`. The fix should be to check if the model instance has a `filterable` attribute that is a field, not just any attribute.\n\nLooking at the code, the problem is in the `check_filterable` method. The method checks `if hasattr(value, 'filterable')` which will be True for any model instance that has a field named `filterable`, even if that field is a regular BooleanField and not a special filterable flag.\n\nThe fix should be to check if the `filterable` attribute is a field, not just any attribute. Here's the fix:\n\n# path: django/db/models/sql/query.py\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\n    def check_filterable(self, expression):\n        \"\"\"Raise an error if expression is not filterable.\"\"\"\n        if not getattr(expression, 'filterable', True):\n            raise NotSupportedError(\n                expression.__class__.__name__ + ' is disallowed in the filter '\n                'clause.'\n            )\n        if hasattr(expression, 'get_ancestors') and hasattr(expression, 'get_descendants'):\n            raise NotSupportedError(\n                expression.__class__.__name__ + ' is disallowed in the filter '\n                'clause.'\n            )\n        if isinstance(expression, Field) and expression.is_relation:\n            raise NotSupportedError(\n                expression.__class__.__name__ + ' is disallowed in the filter '\n                'clause.'\n            )\n=======\n    def check_filterable(self, expression):\n        \"\"\"Raise an error if expression is not filterable.\"\"\"\n        if not getattr(expression, 'filterable', True):\n            raise NotSupportedError(\n                expression.__class__.__name__ + ' is disallowed in the filter '\n                'clause.'\n            )\n        if hasattr(expression, 'get_ancestors') and hasattr(expression, 'get_descendants'):\n            raise NotSupportedError(\n                expression.__class__.__name__ + ' is disallowed in the filter '\n                'clause.'\n            )\n        if isinstance(expression, Field) and expression.is_relation:\n            raise NotSupportedError(\n                expression.__class__.__name__ + ' is disallowed in the filter '\n                'clause.'\n            )\n        if hasattr(expression, 'filterable') and not isinstance(expression, Field):\n            # Check if the filterable attribute is a field, not just any attribute\n            if not isinstance(getattr(expression, 'filterable'), Field):\n                raise NotSupportedError(\n                    expression.__class__.__name__ + ' is disallowed in the filter '\n                    'clause.'\n                )\n>>>>>>> REPLACE","round":1,"slot":0},"producer":{"instance":"01KZQAM783FE6E5HX7Q5B9HYB3","kind":"drafter","parent":"01KZQAM77WAHP3EVG2GR930D6Q"},"schema":"Candidate@1","seq":14,"t":1786415558.139138}
